# Window W5 of the ACPI specification (§7.4): the publication of the routes of q35's PCI interrupt pins, every root
# bridge's _PRT and the links it names read (§3.11), on a release server kernel (SMOKE_TESTS=0 ./build.sh --server). The
# boot keeps the PIC model until the I/O APIC takes the PCI interrupts, so q35's _PRT names its eight LNKx links.
